{"id":1030202,"name":"코히·심문 II","type":"trial","scenes":[{"id":1,"name":"코히·심문 II","code_name":"","dialogue_ids":[1030202]}],"trial":{"trial_id":30202,"stage":"2단계","unlock_time":"2023-05-30 14:00:00","diary1":"당신은 코히와 함께 외출해 부랑아의 거점으로 이동해 도난당한 변이 결정의 행방을 찾으러 갔다.","diary2":"당신은 아이들과 얘기하던 중 일부 아이들이 변이 결정에 대해 잘알고 있다는 것을 알게 되었고, 며칠 동안 실종된 '샨티'라는 부랑아의 일원이 어쩌면 이번 도난 사건의 진짜 주모자일지도 모른다고 생각하게 되었다.\n　　하지만 당신이 샨티를 찾은 후, 그녀는 변이 결정을 훔친 적 없다고 완강히 주장했고, 당신을 도와 변이 결정을 찾는 대신 비호를 요청했다.","evidence":[{"ID":260377,"Num":1}],"usable_items":[{"ID":260378,"Num":1}],"reward":[{"ID":240001,"Num":50}],"obey_award":100,"qte_failure":0,"failure_step":0,"graph":[{"step":1,"course":2,"dialogue_id":130202001,"next":null},{"step":2,"course":2,"dialogue_id":130202002,"next":null},{"step":3,"course":2,"dialogue_id":130202003,"next":null},{"step":4,"course":2,"dialogue_id":130202004,"next":null},{"step":5,"course":2,"dialogue_id":130202005,"next":null},{"step":6,"course":2,"dialogue_id":130202006,"next":null},{"step":7,"course":2,"dialogue_id":130202007,"next":null},{"step":8,"course":2,"dialogue_id":130202008,"next":null},{"step":9,"course":2,"dialogue_id":130202009,"next":null},{"step":10,"course":2,"dialogue_id":130202010,"next":null},{"step":11,"course":2,"dialogue_id":130202011,"next":null},{"step":12,"course":2,"dialogue_id":130202012,"next":null},{"step":13,"course":3,"dialogue_id":130202013,"next":[14]},{"step":14,"course":2,"dialogue_id":130202014,"next":null},{"step":15,"course":2,"dialogue_id":130202015,"next":null},{"step":16,"course":2,"dialogue_id":130202016,"next":null},{"step":17,"course":2,"dialogue_id":130202017,"next":null},{"step":18,"course":2,"dialogue_id":130202018,"next":null},{"step":19,"course":2,"dialogue_id":130202019,"next":null},{"step":20,"course":3,"dialogue_id":130202020,"next":[21]},{"step":21,"course":2,"dialogue_id":130202021,"next":null},{"step":22,"course":2,"dialogue_id":130202022,"next":null},{"step":23,"course":2,"dialogue_id":130202023,"next":null},{"step":24